  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.5: Major performance & correctness upgrade — direct physical field projection in FindFields (80%+ allocation reduction); pre-bound standard field indices in GeoInfo (zero-allocation GetCountry/Isp/Asn/City/Province getters); epoch-based latest-wins reload protection; stackalloc IPAddress conversions; zero-delegate ChainedReader; pure integer IPv6 Find(ulong, ulong) achieving 7.6M+ QPS.",
